abstract: >-
  Nirmata is an independent research program for evaluating AI agents from
  execution trajectories, delegated-authority events, tool calls, state
  transitions, and external effects in addition to final outputs.
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - agent evaluation
  - execution trajectories
  - delegated authority
  - agentic AI safety
  - human-in-the-loop
  - control integrity
  - reproducible evaluation
